[Cut content: DEBUG on the title screen (replaces VS MODE CUSTOM)]
author=Claude for Daniel
description=Brings back the cut DEBUG item on the title menu. The third menu slot (VS MODE CUSTOM) gets action 5, which opens the developer menu at 0x00340220 (SCENE PLAYER, LANGUAGE, EXIT), and its label is switched to the leftover "DEBUG" string. VS MODE NORMAL still works. See docs/CUTCONTENT.md.
patch=1,EE,2058969C,extended,00000005
patch=1,EE,205897D0,extended,00000007

[Cut content: all six languages in the debug LANGUAGE menu]
author=Claude for Daniel
description=The debug LANGUAGE screen (0x003B7400) only lets you pick JAPANESE or ENGLISH. This lets the cursor reach FRANCE, GERMANY, SPAIN and ITALY too; the disc has all six text banks. Use it together with the DEBUG title cheat.
patch=1,EE,203B75F0,extended,28420006
patch=1,EE,203B75D0,extended,24020005

[Cut content: developer debug mode (switch 5)]
author=Claude for Daniel
description=Turns on developer debug switch 5 in the unused switch table at 0x00599000. In a fight or in free roam, hold L2 and press R2 to show or hide the developer fighter overlay, and hold L2 and click L3 to page through its 10 pages (action and motion IDs, HP, damage, injuries, attack/defence, states, loaded animations). Tested in PCSX2. The code also has a hold-R1 speed-up while walking, but R1 is grab, so it can't be used. See docs/CUTCONTENT.md.
patch=1,EE,20599014,extended,00000001

[Cut content: DIFFICULTY in the pause menu options]
author=Claude for Daniel
description=Adds the DIFFICULTY option (record 0x00509D90) to the pause menu's OPTIONS, CONFIG. page (byte +27). Without the cheat it is only in the title-screen OPTIONS. Tested in PCSX2. 1 = EASY, 2 = NORMAL, 3 = HARD.
patch=1,EE,20509DA8,extended,01010100

[Aaron uses the cut TESTER moveset (one Aaron cheat at a time)]
author=Claude for Daniel
description=Gives Aaron style 0x09, the developers' TESTER style: 67 commands mixing moves from many styles, with no MOVE LIST entry, and TESTER_M's animation groups (both medium bodies, so a plain swap). Turn on only one Aaron cheat at a time, and restart the game after switching.
patch=1,EE,2050D8B4,extended,00000009
patch=1,EE,2050D8BC,extended,0050D2E0

[Cut content: boxers use the short boxer style 0x1C]
author=Claude for Daniel
description=Points BOXER_S, BOXER_M and BOXER_L at style 0x1C, one of eight short versions of the generic styles that no class row uses (Jab, Boxer Step, Punch Combo, Left Hook Combo, Uppercut Combo). They keep the boxer animation group 166, which has those moves.
patch=1,EE,2050D6A4,extended,0000001C
patch=1,EE,2050D6B4,extended,0000001C
patch=1,EE,2050D6C4,extended,0000001C

[Story roster: Aaron is Chester with Ignacy's moves]
